DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261117T170000
SUMMARY:AI in Production: Introduction to MLOps — Training at EPFL
LOCATION:EPFL\, Lausanne
DESCRIPTION:One-day SDSC training on designing\, deploying and operating ML
  systems at scale — version control\, CI/CD\, experiment tracking\, moni
 toring\, drift detection and automated retraining. Registration closes 24 
 September.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss Data Science Center\n\nDetails and registra
 tion: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/sdsc-mlops-introduction-epfl-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/sdsc-mlops-introduction-epfl-2026/
